# Test Fix Policy — PlasticOS Addendum

**Authority:** Global `@.cursor-commands/rules/95-test-fix-policy.mdc` (never skip tests — fix fixtures). This overlay adds Odoo 19 PlasticOS patterns only.

## Odoo 19 Product Types

```python
# Odoo 19 — storable products use type='consu'
product = self.env["product.product"].create({"name": "X", "type": "consu"})
```

| Odoo 18 | Odoo 19 | Description |
|---------|---------|-------------|
| `type='product'` | `type='consu'` | Storable products |
| `type='service'` | `type='service'` | Service (unchanged) |

